<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Alex Kapranos</songwriter><songwriter>Nicholas McCarthy</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">众人的目光让我的内心备受煎熬</text><text for="L2">众人的目光将我肆意毁灭</text><text for="L3">现在我的心中燃起了一簇火焰</text><text for="L4">以我残躯化为烈火</text><text for="L5">这簇火焰现已失去控制</text><text for="L6">让我去烧了这座城市</text><text for="L7">将耸立的高楼都烧成灰</text><text for="L8">这簇火焰不再受他人控制</text><text for="L9">让我去烧了这座城市</text><text for="L10">将耸立的高楼都烧成灰</text><text for="L11">这簇火焰不再受世俗控制</text><text for="L12">这簇火焰不再受世俗控制</text><text for="L13">这簇火焰不再受世俗控制</text><text for="L14">就让我尽情燃烧</text><text for="L15">众人的目光 直勾勾地注视着我</text><text for="L16">他们早已麻木 早已被这世俗控制</text><text for="L17">现在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火</text><text for="L18">以我残躯化为烈火</text><text for="L19">这簇火焰现已失去控制</text><text for="L20">让我去烧了这座城市</text><text for="L21">将耸立的高楼都烧成灰</text><text for="L22">这簇火焰不再受他人控制</text><text for="L23">让我去烧了这座城市</text><text for="L24">将耸立的高楼都烧成灰</text><text for="L25">若这簇火焰现已彻底失控</text><text for="L26">我也将要陷入失控 将要化作一簇烈火</text><text for="L27">我的内心正对你燃起情感</text><text for="L28">欲火难平</text><text for="L29">我的内心正对你燃起情感</text><text for="L30">欲火难平</text><text for="L31">内心欲火</text><text for="L32">正熊熊燃烧</text><text for="L33">这簇火焰现已失去控制</text><text for="L34">让我去烧了这座城市</text><text for="L35">将耸立的高楼都烧成灰</text><text for="L36">这簇火焰不再受他人控制</text><text for="L37">让我去烧了这座城市</text><text for="L38">将耸立的高楼都烧成灰</text><text for="L39">这簇火焰不再受世俗控制</text><text for="L40">就让我们一起去烧了这座城市</text><text for="L41">将耸立的高楼都烧成灰</text><text for="L42">这簇火焰不再受世俗控制</text><text for="L43">就让我</text><text for="L44">就让我</text><text for="L45">就让我以残躯化作烈火</text><text for="L46">就让我以残躯化作烈火</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:16.350" end="3:20.930"><p begin="0:16.350" end="0:19.663" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.350" end="0:16.590">Eyes</span> <span begin="0:16.590" end="0:17.150">boring</span> <span begin="0:17.150" end="0:17.410">a</span> <span begin="0:17.410" end="0:18.097">way</span> <span begin="0:18.097" end="0:18.442">through</span> <span begin="0:18.442" end="0:19.663">me</span></p><p begin="0:20.670" end="0:25.480" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.670" end="0:23.010">Eyes</span> <span begin="0:23.010" end="0:23.780">destroying</span> <span begin="0:23.780" end="0:24.170">so</span> <span begin="0:24.170" end="0:25.480">sweetly</span></p><p begin="0:27.070" end="0:32.450" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.070" end="0:29.720">Now</span> <span begin="0:29.720" end="0:30.100">there</span> <span begin="0:30.100" end="0:30.340">is</span> <span begin="0:30.340" end="0:30.460">a</span> <span begin="0:30.460" end="0:31.210">fire</span> <span begin="0:31.210" end="0:31.380">in</span> <span begin="0:31.380" end="0:32.450">me</span></p><p begin="0:32.830" end="0:40.560" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.830" end="0:32.980">A</span> <span begin="0:32.980" end="0:33.500">fire</span> <span begin="0:33.500" end="0:33.750">that</span> <span begin="0:33.750" end="0:40.560">burns</span></p><p begin="0:40.780" end="0:43.290" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.780" end="0:41.330">This</span> <span begin="0:41.330" end="0:42.040">fire</span> <span begin="0:42.040" end="0:42.270">is</span> <span begin="0:42.270" end="0:42.470">out</span> <span begin="0:42.470" end="0:43.290">of control</span></p><p begin="0:43.290" end="0:45.140" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.290" end="0:43.420">I'm</span> <span begin="0:43.420" end="0:43.6